{"key": "674ded5c4e9916292d278c87ec23cf58", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "{\"standalone\":\"A Get Clássica imprime comprovante e aceita pagamento por aproximação com relógio?\",\"search_queries\":[\"Get Clássica impressão de comprovante\",\"Get Clássica pagamento por aproximação relógio\"],\"intent\":\"knowledge\",\"plan\":[\"faq\"],\"language\":\"pt\",\"confidence\":0.9}", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghzapZXkhLrpp2WtquQp", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2965, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 381, "output_tokens": 116, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "router", "scope": "q-partial-05#0"}
{"key": "b0570b4d68422b36d7467a9e407f3188", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "The sources don't give an exact monthly fee or a battery life in hours for the Get Smart.\n\n- **Monthly fee:** App subscriptions are charged by the developer companies, and you negotiate those directly with them. Getnet is paid the rental amount and the administrative fees [2][5]. The sources don't state the rental amount or the administrative fee.\n- **Battery:** The sources give no battery life in hours. They only advise charging whenever possible, preferably for at least 3 hours straight. They also say not to wait for the battery to run fully down, and to charge it when it reaches 20% [1].\n\nMISSING: exact Get Smart monthly rental/administrative fee and battery life in hours", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghzaiyvY5evXKuHKzAXh", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 2371}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2371, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2256, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4, "output_tokens": 225, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-02#0"}
{"key": "f56a958b7a17929b0effdf376a4d68d3", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "A Antecipação Automática é condição para a isenção de quem escolhe o plano \"Receba Conforme suas Vendas\". Como envolve aprovação de crédito, a Getnet avalia cada contrato individualmente para conceder ou não o produto [sup-duvidas-100]. A condição do seu CNPJ depende dessa avaliação.\n\nAntecipar vendas pelo Aplicativo Getnet Brasil não tem taxas adicionais de uso [sup-duvidas-15]. Isso vale para o uso do aplicativo e não informa a taxa da antecipação.\n\nNão encontrei nas fontes uma taxa numérica da Antecipação Automática, nem uma taxa específica para o seu CNPJ. Um atendente humano pode tratar o seu caso individual [policy:capabilities]. Quer que eu encaminhe para um?", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghzaigZAkP7DkY3WWbVf", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 621}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 621, "cache_read_input_tokens": 3253, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 290, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-partial-01#0"}
{"key": "08c51d2819c16596f59e8c22196969b1", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Yes, the cardholder pays interest on Crediário. The interest is shown in a simulation on the card machine (credit > crediário), and the machine can also print the simulation receipt [2]. The maximum number of installments and the interest rate vary by card issuer [1][2].\n\nThe sources do not give an approval time. They only say the simulation is for consultation and subject to credit analysis. The card issuer approves the transaction at the moment of contracting [2]. What they do give is the payment time for you as the merchant: sales are paid within 2 business days after the transaction is captured, in a single payment, regardless of the number of installments [4].\n\nMISSING: Crediário approval time (how long the issuer's approval takes)", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghzaqYJiArdjV43PcFxu", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 2167}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2167, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2256, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4, "output_tokens": 227, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-04#0"}
{"key": "a1d873c48bfc41dda1a737159329f0b6", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"caller": {"type": "direct"}, "id": "toolu_01RjpX7Q7LE4e7RAvEk93TVF", "input": {"query": "A maquininha Get Clássica imprime comprovante e aceita pagamento por aproximação (NFC) com relógio?"}, "name": "faq_agent", "type": "tool_use"}], "id": "msg_011CghzavMmnnbVx4eUbByVr", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "tool_use", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 984}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 984, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2275, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4, "output_tokens": 89, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-partial-05#0"}
{"key": "cbbf3312c8e5ad31c78bd4b9176324c4", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "The Get Smart's exact monthly fee and its battery life in hours aren't in the sources.\n\n- **Monthly fee:** Getnet is paid the rental amount and the administrative fees. The sources don't state either amount. Developer companies charge for app subscriptions, and you negotiate those with them directly [sup-get-smart-12][sup-taxas-19].\n- **Battery:** The sources give no battery life in hours. They advise charging whenever you can, preferably for at least 3 hours straight. Don't wait for the battery to run fully down. Charge it when it reaches 20% [sup-get-smart-03].\n\nI can pass your case to a human agent to confirm the exact fee and battery life if you'd like.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cghzavyjy64JzC4vyg6fB", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 506}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 506, "cache_read_input_tokens": 3152, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 233, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-partial-02#0"}
{"key": "16bb886fbe7b8f6fad82ac74806145b3", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Yes, the buyer pays interest on Crediário. The card machine shows it in a simulation under credit > crediário, and it can also print the simulation receipt [sup-crediario-03]. The maximum number of installments and the interest rate depend on the card issuer [prod-crediario-02][sup-crediario-03].\n\n- **Approval:** The issuer approves the transaction at the moment of contracting. The simulation is for consultation only and is subject to credit analysis [sup-crediario-03].\n- **Your payment as the merchant:** Sales are paid within 2 business days after the transaction is captured. You get a single payment, whatever the number of installments [sup-duvidas-37].\n\nThe sources don't give a specific approval time in minutes or hours. I can pass your question to a human agent if you'd like.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghzazMtX37oWqk69rzBA", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 514}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 514, "cache_read_input_tokens": 3150, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 260, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-partial-04#0"}
